  "releaseNotes": "## Changes\n* Updated dependencies\n* Moved Builder implementations back to CliInvoke from CliInvoke.Core\n* Moved primitives out of CliInvoke.Core into DotPrimitives\n* Moved ``IFilePathResolver`` into CliInvoke.Core  - Thereby allowing the removal of Resyslib.IO.Core as a dependency\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- add Initial Process Timeout Support @alastairlundy (#53) - ``IProcessInvoker`` and ``IProcessFactory`` have been updated to support this.\n- Added method ProcessConfiguration supporting method overloads for ``ContinueWhenExitAsync``, ``ContinueWhenBufferedExitAsync``, and ``ContinueWhenPipedAsync`` to `IProcessInvoker``, and ``IProcessFactory``",
